# PLAN CLI THREE — LSP complete, launch --exec, bench

File: openOODA/audit/plan_cli_three.oot
Process only. Not product. Disk is the source, not ROADMAP.
Owner: build ships 1, 2, and 3. Do not change the public site.
Do not edit oodac/, runtime/, or std/. Other agent owns those trees.

## 1. The three ships

  1. Product `ooda lsp` serves `textDocument/completion`.
  2. `ooda launch --exec NAME` runs the pinned `.oo` after the gate.
  3. `ooda bench FILE` times a real check and prints wall ms.

## 2. Isolation

  One clean worktree per ship, from commit `64ef8bd` (ooda main).
  Do not write in `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda` while it is dirty.
  Rebuild only the CLI. Never rebuild `oodac/oodac`.

  From a worktree root (`ooda/`):
    OODAC_BIN=./bootstrap/seed/oodac \
      bash bootstrap/oodac_pure_build cli/main.oo bin/ooda

  Seed compiler only. Do not use a mid-flight `oodac/oodac`.
  Never copy `bin/ooda` onto `oodac/oodac`.

  File law: `.oo` product, `.oot` process. No `.py` / `.md` / extra `.sh`.
  Every file stays <= 256 lines. Academy header required.

## 3. File owners (no overlap across ships)

  Ship 1 write:
    cli/lsp_complete.oo (new)
    cli/lsp_reply.oo
    cli/lsp_drive.oo (only if dispatch must change)
    scripts/lsp_complete_smoke.oo (new)
    fixtures/lsp_complete_probe.oo (new)
  Ship 1 must not edit hover or definition behavior.

  Ship 2 write:
    cli/cmd_pm_launch.oo
    cli/pm_launch.oo (only if gate API must change)
    fixtures/pm_launch_exec/ (new runnable payload)
    scripts/pm_launch_exec_smoke.oo (new)
    qa/pm_hostile_spine.oo (add --exec run and refuse cases)
  Ship 2 must not grow ooda/pm/.

  Ship 3 write:
    cli/cmd_more.oo
    cli/main.oo (help line + TimeCap on main if required)
    scripts/bench_smoke.oo (new)
  Ship 3 must not invent a fuzzer.

  Shared read-only: host_run.oo, find_compiler.oo, existing lsp_ident.oo.
  If two ships need the same file, COORD serializes. Default: only ship 3
  may edit main.oo. Ship 1 and 2 do not touch main.oo.

## 4. DAG

  Parallel: three worktrees, three phalanxes, same clock.
  Barrier: no ship merges until its 12 role files exist and INT is green.
  Then three skeptics run on all three binaries.
  Then COORD rollup. Then owner says merge.

## 5. Out of scope

  Public site, guide, registry HTML, wiki.
  oodac, runtime C, product std, org std.
  vscode JS. VS Code already starts `ooda lsp`.
  `ooda/lsp/` is not the launch path. Do not grow it.
  `ooda test --fuzz`. Public install. `curl | oo`.

## 6. Role files

  Each role writes one audit note under audit/:
    audit/plan1_<role>.oot  ship 1
    audit/plan2_<role>.oot  ship 2
    audit/plan3_<role>.oot  ship 3
    audit/plan_sk1.oot audit/plan_sk2.oot audit/plan_sk3.oot
  Role files are proof notes. They are not a second product.

